<title>GERMANY: LUGE-MEN'S RESULTS FROM ALTENBERG WORLD CUP EVENT.</title>
<headline>LUGE-MEN'S RESULTS FROM ALTENBERG WORLD CUP EVENT.</headline>
<dateline>ALTENBERG, Germany 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's pairs</p>
<p>competition at World Cup event in Altenberg on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Chris Thorpe/Gordy Sheer (U.S.)			 One minute</p>
<p>26.593 seconds (43.310/43.283).</p>
<p>2. Gerhard Plankensteiner/Oswald Haselrieder (Italy) 1:26.724</p>
<p>(43.346/43.338).</p>
<p> 3. Stefan Krausse/Jan Behrendt (Germany)		 1:26.802</p>
<p>(43.373/43.429).</p>
<p> 4. Steffen Skel/Steffen Woeller (Germany)		1:26.898</p>
<p>(43.589/43.309).</p>
<p> 5. Tobias Schiegl/Markus Schiegl (Austria)	     1:27.049</p>
<p>(43.574/43.479).</p>
<p>World Cup standings after three events:</p>
<p> 1. Thorp/Sheer				 102 points.</p>
<p> 2. Krausse/Behrendt			  88</p>
<p> 3. Skel/Woeller				82</p>
<p> 4. Kurt Brugger/Wilfried Huber (Italy) 79</p>
<p> 5. Plankensteiner/Haselrieder	    78</p>
